safix: 'keepassxc' is a target keyword, not a mapping name.

sync and audit read clan and keepassxc as target keywords, never as
mapping names — no declared mapping may be named either, or 'all'.
Name the mapping you meant, or drop it to act on every mapping of the
target already named.
